  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Hu Immortal blessed land has basic time path dao marks, so it can draw in a tributary of the River of Time, allowing time to exist in the blessed land and to flow. Tai Bai Yun Sheng’s Tai Bai blessed land is most numerous in time path dao marks, so its time based resources are abundant: one day in the outside world is thirty-three days inside.",
      "chapters": [
        821
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_hu_immortal_blessed_land",
        "loc_tributary_of_the_river_of_time",
        "char_tai_bai_yun_sheng",
        "loc_tai_bai_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "General dao marks and attainment levels are covered on dao marks and attainment.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_dao_marks"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "If a time path Gu Immortal uses a time path method on themselves, as Hei Fan does, the effect is amplified by that Gu Immortal’s time path dao marks.",
      "chapters": [
        1130
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "amplifying-time-path-methods",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_hei_fan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The River of Time is filled with time path dao marks and has the most time path dao marks in the world. Sound path dao marks conflict with them: Feng Jiu Ge’s sound path killer moves fall to less than ten percent of their original power there. A time path lifeform living in the river has territorial advantage because its own time path dao marks complement the river.",
      "chapters": [
        1404
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "river-of-time-density",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_river_of_time",
        "char_feng_jiu_ge"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Immemorial year beasts have plentiful time path dao marks in their bodies. Their actions have time path effects and can carve time path dao marks in the surroundings. Immemorial year monkeys live in the River of Time with eyes submerged in the river water, where the densest concentration of time path dao marks sits.",
      "chapters": [
        1429
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "year-beasts-carve-marks",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Year beast lifeforms are covered on year beast.",
